  "confidence": "moderate",
  "decision_summary": "The query is a chlordiazepoxide-like 1,4-benzodiazepine N-oxide. All relevant benzodiazepine analogues with experimental bioavailability data show oral F values well above 20%, and no contradictory evidence was identified. Although Morgan similarities are low, the consistent high-bioavailability phenotype across the benzodiazepine class supports a high prediction.",
